<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian stocks seen marching to upbeat tempo.</title>
<headline>Australian stocks seen marching to upbeat tempo.</headline>
<text>
<p>-----------------(Snapshot 8.40 a.m./2230 GMT)-----------------</p>
<p>AORD cl	   2442.40  +29.20   DJIA  cl	6703.55  +44.95</p>
<p>SPI Sycom cl	 2436	-2   US 30yr cl	 7.05   -0.02</p>
<p>10yrbond futs    92.150  -0.015   Gold NY 341.35 Lon fix 342.10</p>
<p>AUD	   0.7740 (Fri 0.7753)   CRB Index cl   247.34   +2.03</p>
<p>NIKKEI cl	18532.14 +258.73   FTSE cl	 4310.50  +11.60</p>
<p>S&amp;P500(Globex)   770.10   -0.15   NZSE40	  2257.11   -0.20</p>
<p>--------------------------(Apr 21)-----------------------------</p>
<p>*Stocks seen continuing upbeat, buyers still about. &quot;I think there is more in it. There was plenty of interest on Friday and it's likely you will see more today,&quot; said a Sydney broker.</p>
